{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45437","headline":"送玉禅师 · 善生","name":"送玉禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘然无定迹，迥与律乘违。\n入郭随缘住，思山破夏归。\n盂擎数家饭，衲乞几人衣。\n洞了曹溪旨，宁输俗者机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"善生","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}